direction: right
prompt: merger prompt (Jina markdown)
hook: UserPromptSubmit hook
cli: claude -p
gate: assert gate
publish: publish
qa: QA evaluator
loud: fail loud / quarantine
prompt -> hook: contains ![Image](url)
hook -> cli: blocked before model
cli -> gate: rc=0, num_turns=0
gate -> loud: turns=0 or items < floor
gate -> publish: passes
publish -> qa: after publish
qa -> loud: P0 below floor
